      "lineNbr": 69,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060151
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-03-17T04:30:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the problem is that the sim state change and carrier config change will all happen in rapid succession, like 3 or 4 in short succession. I\u0027m not so sure that we shouldn\u0027t just cache it and save pulling that much data over the binder while a million other things are happening.",
